のウタウ、佐引清子（参考リンクはこちら：https://toyhou.se/16818006.seiko-sabiki#51295480）のこんなシーンを描いていただけませんか？(https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/vocaloid/images/9/92/Zwnj_Rcsg3vWfnWw.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200917091045)\nなお、聖子は11歳で、背中の取っ手がデザイン上、とても重要です。\n\nYouTubeの動画に使いたいので、それでいいという方のみお受けください。動画の説明文だけでなく、動画自体にもフルクレジットを表示します。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@paraparakoi/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 126911, "client_id": 111082, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88ef70c5/uploads/origins/79bf3062-c2a3-43c9-8bdd-2621cb24d6a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6063b0e8abea632e53cd5207eaf5089", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88ef70c5/uploads/origins/79bf3062-c2a3-43c9-8bdd-2621cb24d6a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6063b0e8abea632e53cd5207eaf5089, https://si.imgix.net/88ef70c5/uploads/origins/79bf3062-c2a3-43c9-8bdd-2621cb24d6a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7704c3d86578e18e40275af24773ee81 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88ef70c5/uploads/origins/79bf3062-c2a3-43c9-8bdd-2621cb24d6a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=338dedab78602264b646ca994595b0ab 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88ef70c5/uploads/origins/79bf3062-c2a3-43c9-8bdd-2621cb24d6a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ef05d4833cf781653a00dc976e31c99", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88ef70c5/uploads/origins/79bf3062-c2a3-43c9-8bdd-2621cb24d6a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ef05d4833cf781653a00dc976e31c99, https://si.imgix.net/88ef70c5/uploads/origins/79bf3062-c2a3-43c9-8bdd-2621cb24d6a2?bg=%